{"4608460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MORI", "steam_appid": 4608460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608460/extras/44cf21ae195742b53e2b60fd75d55693.avif?t=1787810233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608460/extras_big/44cf21ae195742b53e2b60fd75d55693.webp?t=1787810233 width=1560 height=111 /></span>Follow Mori, self-proclaimed Grim-Reaper on a quest for revenge after her partner is killed in a gang shooting. Fight through a criminal empire, hang out with your friends and cling desperately onto your humanity in a story about what it means to lose yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608460/extras/2b0ab5bf63d29edc0cc1a4c2ef59e8b4.avif?t=1787810233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608460/extras_big/2b0ab5bf63d29edc0cc1a4c2ef59e8b4.webp?t=1787810233 width=1560 height=98 /></span>MORI puts an emphasis on speed and fluidity, offering a simple set of tools that when mastered, allow for stages to be cleared at breakneck speeds. Armed with nothing but your scythe and cloak, cut through armies of foes and use their blood to unleash devastating attack. Break the boundaries of the levels themselves by harnessing a powerful dash that grants the ability to pass through walls, creating shortcuts and discovering hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[please note the game is still in development, and anything seen here may not reflect the final product]</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><